      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Every great quote\ndeserves a home",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 82
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "You've dog-eared pages, scribbled in margins, and highlighted passages that moved you. Readr gives those moments a permanent place.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 87
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Capture any page",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 112
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Hold your phone over any book page. Readr automatically detects the page boundaries and extracts the text in seconds.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 117
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Build your library",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 142
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Every quote you capture is organized by book. Flip through your collection — find that passage you loved in *Sapiens* or that poem you bookmarked years ago.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 147
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Never lose a quote again",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 174
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "The books you read leave marks on you. Let's make sure you remember them. Ready to scan your first page?",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 179
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Start Scanning",
